#: ../../extend/storage.md:1
msgid "存储驱动（`catalog = \"upload\"`）"
msgstr "Storage drivers (`catalog = \"upload\"`)"

#: ../../extend/storage.md:3
msgid ""
"存储驱动只做一件事：**把一段字节写到某个对象存储，并告诉核心它落在哪**。 优先级、多副本、可见性、有效期、删除时机全部由 "
"`sapic/libs/storage.py` 决定， 驱动不要自己维护这些。"
msgstr ""
"A storage driver does one thing: **write a chunk of bytes to some object "
"storage and tell the core where it landed**. Priority, replicas, "
"visibility, expiry and deletion timing all belong to "
"`sapic/libs/storage.py` — drivers must not maintain any of that."

#: ../../extend/storage.md:7
msgid "契约"
msgstr "Contract"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "函数"
msgstr "Function"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "必需"
msgstr "Required"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "说明"
msgstr "Description"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`upimg_save`"
msgstr "`upimg_save`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "✅"
msgstr "✅"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "写入对象。`stream` 是 `bytes`（也可能是带 `read()` 的文件对象，两种都要兼容）。"
msgstr ""
"Write the object. `stream` is `bytes` (it may also be a file object with "
"`read()` — support both)."

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`upimg_delete`"
msgstr "`upimg_delete`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "建议"
msgstr "Recommended"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"删除一个副本。**不要抛异常**，失败返回 `{\"code\": 1, \"message\": ...}`；缺失时副本删不掉，`warnings`"
" 会提示。"
msgstr ""
"Delete one replica. **Never raise**: return `{\"code\": 1, \"message\": "
"...}` on failure; without it the replica cannot be deleted and `warnings` "
"reports it."

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`upimg_url`"
msgstr "`upimg_url`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "私有桶必需"
msgstr "Required for private buckets"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "签发临时读地址，见下文「私有桶」。只在后端 `visibility=private` 时被调用。"
msgstr ""
"Issue a temporary read URL, see Private buckets below. Only called for "
"backends with `visibility=private`."

#: ../../extend/storage.md:23
msgid "`upimg_save` 的参数："
msgstr "`upimg_save` arguments:"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Argument"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`filename`"
msgstr "`filename`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "已清洗的目标文件名（含后缀，可能带 sha 片段），由核心生成"
msgstr ""
"Sanitised target filename (with extension, possibly including a sha "
"fragment), generated by the core"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`stream`"
msgstr "`stream`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "文件内容"
msgstr "File content"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`upload_path`"
msgstr "`upload_path`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "对象前缀（`{用户}/{Y}/{m}/{d}`），与 `filename` 拼成对象键"
msgstr ""
"Object prefix (`{user}/{Y}/{m}/{d}`), joined with `filename` to form the "
"object key"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`backend`"
msgstr "`backend`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "该次调用使用的后端配置：`{id, name, hook_name, config, visibility, priority}`"
msgstr ""
"Backend config used for this call: `{id, name, hook_name, config, "
"visibility, priority}`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md:32
msgid ""
"`backend[\"config\"]` 是合并结果：钩子级默认值 → 后端行的 `config` → 运行时补充 （本地驱动会补 `root = "
"STORAGE_DIR`）。所以同一个驱动可以被配置成多个后端实例， 每个实例有独立凭据/目录。"
msgstr ""
"`backend[\"config\"]` is merged: hook-level defaults → the backend row "
"`config` → runtime additions (the local driver gets `root = STORAGE_DIR`). "
"One driver can therefore back several backend instances, each with its own "
"credentials or directory."

#: ../../extend/storage.md:36
msgid ""
"返回值（这是**驱动函数的返回字典**，由 `libs/storage.py` 解析，不是 HTTP 响应体。失败原因统一写 "
"`message`；沿用老字段 `msg` 也还能被识别，但新代码不要再用）："
msgstr ""
"Return value (this is the **driver function return dict**, parsed by "
"`libs/storage.py`, not an HTTP body. Failure reasons always go into "
"`message`; the legacy field `msg` is still recognised, but new code must "
"not use it):"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "键"
msgstr "Key"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`code`"
msgstr "`code`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`0` 成功；非 0 失败，上传请求随之失败（主后端）或记 `state=failed`（副本）"
msgstr ""
"`0` for success; non-zero fails: the upload fails (primary backend) or the "
"replica is recorded as `state=failed`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`message`"
msgstr "`message`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "失败原因（英文），写进 `image_backends.last_error`"
msgstr "Failure reason (English), stored in `image_backends.last_error`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`path`"
msgstr "`path`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "对象键，删除时用它定位"
msgstr "Object key; used to locate the object on delete"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`src`"
msgstr "`src`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "可直接访问的绝对地址。只在桶**公有读**且配了域名时返回；省略（或不配域名）就由 sapic 的 `/raw/<sha>` 输出。私有桶不要返回它"
msgstr ""
"Absolute URL usable directly. Return it only when the bucket is **public-"
"read** and a domain is configured; omit it (or configure no domain) and "
"sapic serves the image from `/raw/<sha>`. Never return it for private "
"buckets"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`size`"
msgstr "`size`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "字节数，缺省用上传长度的值"
msgstr "Byte count; defaults to the uploaded length"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`etag`"
msgstr "`etag`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "存储侧校验值/版本号，删除时可用于精确定位"
msgstr "Storage-side checksum / version, usable for exact deletion"

#: ../../extend/storage.md:48
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`upimg_delete` 的参数：`sha`、`upload_path`、`filename`、`basedir` （配置里的 "
"`root`，远程驱动一般忽略）、`save_result` （`{path, size, "
"etag}`，来自保存时的返回值）、`backend`。返回 `{\"code\": 0}` 表示已删除。"
msgstr ""
"`upimg_delete` arguments: `sha`, `upload_path`, `filename`, `basedir` (the "
"`root` from config, usually ignored by remote drivers), `save_result` "
"(`{path, size, etag}` from the save call) and `backend`. Returning "
"`{\"code\": 0}` means deleted."

#: ../../extend/storage.md:52
msgid "生效方式"
msgstr "How it takes effect"

#: ../../extend/storage.md:54
msgid ""
"在后台启用钩子（`PATCH /api/v2/hooks/<name>`）后，`sync_backends()` 会自动创建一条 "
"`scope=system` 的后端行，所以「启用驱动」就是唯一的必要动作。"
msgstr ""
"Once the hook is enabled in the admin (`PATCH /api/v2/hooks/<name>`), "
"`sync_backends()` creates a `scope=system` backend row automatically, so "
"enabling the driver is the only required action."

#: ../../extend/storage.md:56
msgid ""
"后台「存储后端」页可以再建多个实例（不同桶/目录）、调整优先级、单独配置、启停。 `priority` "
"数值**越小越优先**：写入走数值最小的那行，读取与直链按升序回退。"
msgstr ""
"The admin storage-backends page lets you create more instances (different "
"bucket or directory), adjust priority, configure each one and enable or "
"disable them. A **smaller** `priority` number wins: writes go to the "
"smallest number, reads and direct links fall back in ascending order."

#: ../../extend/storage.md:58
msgid "上传时数值最小的后端同步写，成功后才返回；其余启用后端由后台线程池异步补副本 （`storage_replica` 关掉就只有单副本）。"
msgstr ""
"On upload the smallest-numbered backend is written synchronously and the "
"request returns once it succeeded; the remaining enabled backends get "
"replicas asynchronously from a background thread pool (with "
"`storage_replica` off there is only one replica)."

#: ../../extend/storage.md:60
msgid "删除图片、过期清理都会对每个副本调用 `upimg_delete`；后端仍持有副本时不允许删除该后端。"
msgstr ""
"Deleting an image and expiry cleanup call `upimg_delete` for every replica;"
" a backend that still holds replicas cannot be deleted."

#: ../../extend/storage.md:62
msgid ""
"配置表单字段来自 `hook_manifest()` 的 `config_schema`，`required: true` 没填时后台标 "
"「待配置」、建后端行会 400。驱动可以把「检查连通性」做成 `scope: \"admin\"` 的 action， 并在 "
"`admin.hook_setting` 插槽里渲染针对单个后端的表单（`context[\"backend\"]` 可读当前后端）。"
msgstr ""
"Form fields come from `config_schema` in `hook_manifest()`; a `required: "
"true` field left empty marks the backend as pending in the admin and "
"creating the row returns 400. A driver can expose a connectivity check as "
"an action with `scope: \"admin\"` and render a per-backend form in the "
"`admin.hook_setting` slot (`context[\"backend\"]` gives the current "
"backend)."

#: ../../extend/storage.md:66
msgid ""
"`config_schema` 里有一个**约定键** `thumb_suffix`：服务层只把它原样拼在公开直链后面 "
"（`libs/storage.thumb_suffix`，裸查询串会自动补 `?`），作为列表页与广场的缩略图， 驱动本身不需要处理。桶或 CDN "
"支持图片处理时声明它即可，例如七牛 `?imageView2/2/w/400`、又拍 `!/fw/400`；`src` "
"与分享模板始终是原图，不受影响。"
msgstr ""
"`config_schema` has one **reserved key**, `thumb_suffix`: the service "
"merely appends it to public direct links (`libs/storage.thumb_suffix`, a "
"bare query string gets a `?` prepended) to build list and plaza thumbnails,"
" and the driver does nothing. Declare it when the bucket or CDN supports "
"image processing, e.g. Qiniu `?imageView2/2/w/400` or Upyun `!/fw/400`; "
"`src` and the share templates always use the original image."

#: ../../extend/storage.md:71
msgid "私有桶"
msgstr "Private buckets"

#: ../../extend/storage.md:73
msgid "后端行的 `visibility` 决定 sapic 怎么读对象："
msgstr "The backend row `visibility` decides how sapic reads objects:"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "取值"
msgstr "Value"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "桶的读权限"
msgstr "Bucket read access"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "公开图的 `src`"
msgstr "`src` of public images"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`/raw/<sha>` 的读法"
msgstr "How `/raw/<sha>` reads"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`public`（默认）"
msgstr "`public` (default)"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "公有读（+ CDN 域名）"
msgstr "Public-read (+ CDN domain)"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "直接给驱动返回的直链"
msgstr "The direct link the driver returned"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "本地 `send_file`；远程 302（公开图）或转发（私有图）"
msgstr "Local `send_file`; remote 302 (public images) or proxied (private images)"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`private`"
msgstr "`private`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "**私有读**，匿名请求 403"
msgstr "**Private read**; anonymous requests get 403"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "固定 `/raw/<sha>`"
msgstr "Fixed to `/raw/<sha>`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "本地 `send_file`；远程先调 `upimg_url` 拿临时地址，再由 sapic 转发"
msgstr ""
"Local `send_file`; remote first calls `upimg_url` for a temporary URL, then"
" sapic proxies it"

#: ../../extend/storage.md:80
msgid "`private` 的完整流程："
msgstr "The full `private` flow:"

#: ../../extend/storage.md:82
msgid "`image_src()` 只认 `public` 后端的直链，`private` 后端即使驱动返回了 `src` 也不用；"
msgstr ""
"`image_src()` only honours direct links of `public` backends; a `private` "
"backend's `src` is ignored even if the driver returns one;"

#: ../../extend/storage.md:83
msgid "浏览器请求 `/raw/<sha>`，sapic 先做可见性 / 防盗链校验；"
msgstr ""
"the browser requests `/raw/<sha>`, and sapic first checks visibility and "
"hotlink protection;"

#: ../../extend/storage.md:84
msgid "找到该副本，调驱动的 `upimg_url(save_result, backend, expires)`；"
msgstr ""
"it finds the replica and calls the driver `upimg_url(save_result, backend, "
"expires)`;"

#: ../../extend/storage.md:85
msgid "驱动返回临时读地址（有效期由驱动决定，默认建议 300 秒）；"
msgstr ""
"the driver returns a temporary read URL (lifetime chosen by the driver; 300"
" seconds is the suggested default);"

#: ../../extend/storage.md:86
msgid "sapic 在服务端拉取并流式转发（**不 302**），签名地址与凭据都不会到浏览器；"
msgstr ""
"sapic fetches and streams it server-side (**no 302**), so neither the "
"signed URL nor the credentials reach the browser;"

#: ../../extend/storage.md:87
msgid "某个副本失败就换下一个副本，而不是直接 404。"
msgstr "if one replica fails it tries the next instead of returning 404."

#: ../../extend/storage.md:89
msgid "`upimg_url` 的返回值："
msgstr "`upimg_url` return value:"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`0` 成功；非 0 视为该副本不可读（会尝试下一个）"
msgstr ""
"`0` for success; non-zero means this replica is unreadable (the next one is"
" tried)"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "失败原因（英文，只写日志）"
msgstr "Failure reason (English, logged only)"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`url`"
msgstr "`url`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "临时可读地址；可以是 CDN 地址、签名 URL，或对象存储的 REST 源站地址"
msgstr ""
"Temporary read URL: a CDN URL, a signed URL, or the object-storage REST "
"endpoint"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`headers`"
msgstr "`headers`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "转发时必须追加的请求头。不能把凭据放进 URL 的存储（又拍的 `Authorization` + `Date`）靠它"
msgstr ""
"Headers that must be added when proxying. Storages that cannot put "
"credentials in the URL (Upyun needs `Authorization` + `Date`) rely on it"

#: ../../extend/storage.md:98
msgid "守卫与限制："
msgstr "Guards and limits:"

#: ../../extend/storage.md:100
msgid ""
"后端选 `private` 但驱动没实现 `upimg_url`，建/改后端直接 400 （`driver cannot read private "
"objects: missing upimg_url`），后台「访问方式」里的该选项也会置灰。"
msgstr ""
"Choosing `private` for a backend whose driver lacks `upimg_url` returns 400"
" immediately (`driver cannot read private objects: missing upimg_url`), and"
" that option is greyed out in the admin access-mode field."

#: ../../extend/storage.md:102
msgid "`up2local` 例外：本地副本由 `send_file` 直接读盘，不需要 `upimg_url`，可以设 `private`。"
msgstr ""
"`up2local` is the exception: local replicas are read straight from disk by "
"`send_file`, so no `upimg_url` is needed and `private` works."

#: ../../extend/storage.md:103
msgid "`visibility` 默认 `public`；本次升级前的存量后端行由迁移 `v011` 一次性回填为 `public`，行为不变。"
msgstr ""
"`visibility` defaults to `public`; existing backend rows from before the "
"upgrade were backfilled to `public` by migration `v011`, so behaviour is "
"unchanged."

#: ../../extend/storage.md:104
msgid ""
"转发目标是服务端产生的地址，因此 `/raw` 调用 `open_remote(..., allow_private=True)`：自建 MinIO "
"在 `10.x`/`192.168.x` 也能读。用户提交的 URL（URL 上传、外链登记）仍然走公网校验，二者不可混用。"
msgstr ""
"The proxy target is an address the server generated, so `/raw` calls "
"`open_remote(..., allow_private=True)`: a self-hosted MinIO on "
"`10.x`/`192.168.x` is readable. User-submitted URLs (URL uploads, external-"
"link registration) still go through the public-address checks — the two "
"must never be mixed."

#: ../../extend/storage.md:106
msgid "私有桶会**失去 CDN 直链**：公开图也要过 sapic，按需给公开图单独建一个 `public` 后端并调高优先级。"
msgstr ""
"A private bucket **loses CDN direct links**: public images go through sapic"
" as well, so create a separate `public` backend for public images and give "
"it a higher priority."

#: ../../extend/storage.md:108
msgid "内置驱动的实现方式可以直接参照："
msgstr "The built-in drivers are the reference:"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "驱动"
msgstr "Driver"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`upimg_url` 做法"
msgstr "`upimg_url` approach"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`up2qiniu`"
msgstr "`up2qiniu`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`Auth.private_download_url(domain + \"/\" + key, expires)`；私有桶仍需配 `domain`"
msgstr ""
"`Auth.private_download_url(domain + \"/\" + key, expires)`; a private "
"bucket still needs `domain`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`up2upyun`"
msgstr "`up2upyun`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"无预签名 URL：指向 `https://v0.api.upyun.com/{bucket}/{key}`，返回 `Authorization: "
"UPYUN op:base64(hmac-sha1(md5(pwd), \"GET&uri&date\"))` + `Date`"
msgstr ""
"No presigned URLs: point at `https://v0.api.upyun.com/{bucket}/{key}` and "
"return `Authorization: UPYUN op:base64(hmac-sha1(md5(pwd), "
"\"GET&uri&date\"))` + `Date`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`up2github`"
msgstr "`up2github`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid ""
"私有仓库走 contents API（`Accept: application/vnd.github.raw`），返回 `Authorization:"
" token ...`"
msgstr ""
"Private repositories use the contents API (`Accept: "
"application/vnd.github.raw`) and return `Authorization: token ...`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "`up2local`"
msgstr "`up2local`"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "不需要：`/raw` 直接读盘"
msgstr "Not needed: `/raw` reads the file directly"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "通用对象存储"
msgstr "Generic object storage"

#: ../../extend/storage.md
msgid "S3/OSS/COS/MinIO 都用 SDK 的 presigned URL（见下面示例的 `upimg_url`）"
msgstr ""
"S3 / OSS / COS / MinIO all use the SDK presigned URL (see `upimg_url` in "
"the example below)"

#: ../../extend/storage.md:118
msgid "示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../extend/storage.md:220
msgid "注意"
msgstr "Notes"

#: ../../extend/storage.md:222
msgid "对象的路径规则、文件名、后缀都由核心生成（`upload_path_for()`），驱动不要另造一套。"
msgstr ""
"Object paths, filenames and extensions are all generated by the core "
"(`upload_path_for()`); drivers must not invent their own scheme."

#: ../../extend/storage.md:223
msgid "不要在自己的代码里改图片可见性/过期时间，也不要写业务表；驱动只处理字节。"
msgstr ""
"Never change image visibility or expiry in driver code, and never write "
"business tables; a driver only touches bytes."

#: ../../extend/storage.md:224
msgid "私有图片即使返回了 `src` 也不会直接用，核心固定走 `/raw/<sha>` 转发， 避免暴露源站地址；返回 `src` 只对公开图片生效。"
msgstr ""
"A private image ignores `src` even when returned: the core always proxies "
"through `/raw/<sha>` to avoid exposing the origin address, so `src` only "
"takes effect for public images."

#: ../../extend/storage.md:226
msgid "`upimg_exists` 是 v1 遗留的探测函数，v2 不调用，可以不实现。"
msgstr "`upimg_exists` is a v1 leftover that v2 never calls; it may be omitted."

